.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-07T21:57:59Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T21:57:59Z","body":"It looks like it's unable to find the `Godot.NET.Sdk` package. Can you check if a normal non-Godot C# project can be built?\n\n```bash\nmkdir TestProject\ncd TestProject\ndotnet new console\ndotnet build\n```\n\nIf that works, then maybe it's specifically about the `Godot.NET.Sdk` package. In which case, you'll have to check your NuGet configuration. Run these command from within your Godot project:\n\n```bash\ndotnet nuget list source\n```\n\nIt should list all the NuGet sources available from within your project. Here's what I would expect to see:\n\n```\nRegistered Sources:\n  1.  nuget.org [Enabled]\n      https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json\n```\n\nLet me know if you see something else.\n\nAnother thing worth checking is running `dotnet --info` from within your Godot project. It should list the SDKs and runtimes available, as well as any environment variables or global.json files that may be interfering with your ability to restore/build the C# project.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3865583633/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3866882229","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115970#issuecomment-3866882229","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115970","id":3866882229,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7me_C1","user":{"login":"Saabir14","id":64490729,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDkwNzI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64490729?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14","html_url":"https://github.com/Saabir14","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-08T10:08:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-08T13:58:11Z","body":"Yes, a normal C# project can be built:\n```\n% mkdir TestProject\n% cd TestProject \n% dotnet new console\nThe template \"Console App\" was created successfully.\n\nProcessing post-creation actions...\nRestoring /.../TestProject/TestProject.csproj:\nRestore succeeded.\n\n\n% dotnet build\nRestore complete (0.2s)\n  TestProject net10.0 succeeded (1.8s) → bin/Debug/net10.0/TestProject.dll\n\nBuild succeeded in 2.2s\n```\nThe NuGet configuration is exactly as you expected:\n```\n% dotnet nuget list source\nRegistered Sources:\n  1.  nuget.org [Enabled]\n      https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json\n```\nI ran `dotnet --info` from the project directory and here is the output:\n```\n% dotnet --info\n.NET SDK:\n Version:           10.0.102\n Commit:            4452502459\n Workload version:  10.0.100-manifests.73000c7b\n MSBuild version:   18.0.7+445250245\n\nRuntime Environment:\n OS Name:     Mac OS X\n OS Version:  26.2\n OS Platform: Darwin\n RID:         osx-arm64\n Base Path:   /usr/local/share/dotnet/sdk/10.0.102/\n\n.NET workloads installed:\nThere are no installed workloads to display.\nConfigured to use workload sets when installing new manifests.\nNo workload sets are installed. Run \"dotnet workload restore\" to install a workload set.\n\nHost:\n  Version:      10.0.2\n  Architecture: arm64\n  Commit:       4452502459\n\n.NET SDKs installed:\n  10.0.102 [/usr/local/share/dotnet/sdk]\n\n.NET runtimes installed:\n  Microsoft.AspNetCore.App 10.0.2 [/usr/local/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.AspNetCore.App]\n  Microsoft.NETCore.App 10.0.2 [/usr/local/share/dotnet/shared/Microsoft.NETCore.App]\n\nOther architectures found:\n  x64   [/usr/local/share/dotnet/x64]\n    registered at [/etc/dotnet/install_location_x64]\n\nEnvironment variables:\n  DOTNET_CLI_TELEMETRY_OPTOUT              [1]\n  DOTNET_ROLL_FORWARD_TO_PRERELEASE        [1]\n  DOTNET_ROOT                              [/usr/local/share/dotnet]\n\nglobal.json file:\n  Not found\n\nLearn more:\n  https://aka.ms/dotnet/info\n\nDownload .NET:\n  https://aka.ms/dotnet/download\n```\nI don't really know what the problem here is","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3866882229/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3880834451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115970#issuecomment-3880834451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115970","id":3880834451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nUNWT","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-10T21:34:00Z","updated_at":"2026-02-10T21:34:00Z","body":"Everything looks normal to me. Maybe there's something wrong with your NuGet config but it looks fine on the surface, and you were able to resolve the `Microsoft.NET.Sdk`. It may be worth trying to add a `NuGet.config` file to your Godot project that looks like this:\n\n```xml\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n<configuration>\n  <fallbackPackageFolders>\n    <clear />\n  </fallbackPackageFolders>\n  <packageSources>\n    <clear />\n    <add key=\"nuget.org\" value=\"https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json\" />\n  </packageSources>\n  <packageSourceMapping>\n    <packageSource key=\"nuget.org\">\n      <package pattern=\"*\" />\n    </packageSource>\n  </packageSourceMapping>\n  <disabledPackageSources>\n    <clear />\n  </disabledPackageSources>\n</configuration>\n```\n\nThis will override the NuGet config, so if it's able to build with this we'll know there's something going on in your system-wide configuration.\n\nYou could also try building the Godot project from the terminal with `dotnet build` to check if it's specifically a problem with the build arguments the Godot editor uses to build your project.\n\nOtherwise, it may be an upstream issue on the .NET SDK or NuGet, and will have to be reported in the corresponding `dotnet` repositories.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3880834451/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3897840409","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115970#issuecomment-3897840409","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115970","id":3897840409,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7oVFMZ","user":{"login":"Saabir14","id":64490729,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDkwNzI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64490729?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14","html_url":"https://github.com/Saabir14","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saabir14/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-13T15:31:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T15:31:52Z","body":"I added the config file to my project and tried building using `dotnet build`, but I still get errors:\n```\n% dotnet build\n/Users/.../Test Game/Test Game.csproj : warning Unable to load the service index for source https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json.\nRestore succeeded with 2 warning(s) in 11.0s\n    /Users/.../Test Game/Test Game.csproj : warning NU1503: Skipping restore for project '/Users/Test Game/Test Game.csproj'. The project file may be invalid or missing targets required for restore.\n    /usr/local/share/dotnet/sdk/10.0.102/NuGet.targets(196,5): warning Unable to find a project to restore!\n/Users/.../Test Game/Test Game.csproj : error\n  Could not resolve SDK \"Godot.NET.Sdk\". Exactly one of the probing messages below indicates why we could not resolve the SDK. Invest\n  igate and resolve that message to correctly specify the SDK.\n    SDK resolver \"Microsoft.DotNet.MSBuildWorkloadSdkResolver\" returned null.\n    Unable to find package Godot.NET.Sdk. No packages exist with this id in source(s): nuget.org\n/Users/.../Test Game/Test Game.csproj : warning Unable to load the service index for source https://api.nuget.org/v3/index.json.\n   failed with 1 error(s) (0.0s)\n    /Users/.../Test Game/Test Game.csproj : error MSB4236: The SDK 'Godot.NET.Sdk/4.6.0' specified could not be found.\n\nBuild failed with 2 error(s) and 4 warning(s) in 21.9s\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3897840409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3902640219","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115970#issuecomment-3902640219","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115970","id":3902640219,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7onZBb","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://